      56.13,
      374.17,
      547.25,
      457.24
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby informed that the 31st Higher Ordination Ceremony of the Sri Rohana Sanga Sabhawa is to be held on 13th,14th and 15th May 2016 at Sri Rohana Sanga Sabhawa of Siri Rathanajothi Piriwena, Urapola, Thihagoda and MangalaSeemamalakaya of Randupatha Sri Rohana Upoosathagaraya Maha Vihara, Kotuwegoda, Matara and that the pilgrims shouldrefrain from carrying with them any peastic or polythene materials and that the standing orders and regulations underSection 02 of the Pilgrimage Ordinance (Chapter 175 - L.D.B/11/60) declared on 14th October 1991 and published inthe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, will be in force during the period in which the ceremonyis held.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
